# Atl-Atl: a 220 Hz computer tone, C4 held; the tuner should play C4; then the key is released and the dry tone returns
master 1023
frames 20
usbtone 220 -6
usbrec 2
key 7 down
frames 120
screen build/host/out/atlatl.ppm
wav build/host/out/atlatl.wav
leds
key 7 up
frames 80
wav build/host/out/atlatl_dry.wav
